{"id":"7d230ba22b301f63","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-embeddable.md","title":"Embeddability","display":"df-embeddable — Embeddability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-embeddable","aliases":["58-df-embeddable"],"display":"df-embeddable — Embeddability","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-embedding.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-embeddable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-embeddable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embeddable — Embeddability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"17222759f0140cdd\" href=\"?note=17222759f0140cdd\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-embedding.md\">../batch14/58-df-embedding.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> (structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\)</span> (embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17222759f0140cdd\" href=\"?note=17222759f0140cdd\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-embedding.md\">../batch14/58-df-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (embeddability predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embeddable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embeddable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\leq \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\leq \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> abbreviates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\">\\(\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Isomorphic structures are elementarily equivalent, but the converse can fail even for countable structures.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"17222759f0140cdd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ (structure predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"17222759f0140cdd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Embedding}_S$ (embedding predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-embedding.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embeddable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\leq \\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Embeddable}_S(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B})","display":false}],"bytes":1009,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-embeddable]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-478","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-embeddable.md|58-df-embeddable]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["d9b8711cda3f31ca","17222759f0140cdd"]}